 Changed areas:
 
-- Name and branding: the product is called DocDog; the dog icon replaces the WordCraft icon in every size (PNG, .ico, .icns, .svg); the ArtCraft logo files and README branding are removed; Discord, ArtCraft and GitHub links are replaced by https://www.rng.media or removed.
