 - Network: self-update is always off (Help > Check for Updates only explains this); the language-pack download backend is not started, so no pack or font downloads happen; the Flatpak no longer asks for network or host-Flatpak access; AppImage update info and Windows/AppImage update hooks no longer point at upstream.
-- Engine and tools: user-visible messages, MCP server info (no community links), PDF creator/producer, LaTeX header comment, and sample document link say DocDog / https://www.rng.media.
-- Packaging (`packaging/`): Linux (.desktop, AppStream, nfpm, Flatpak, AppImage), macOS (bundle and DMG names, Info.plist), Windows (WiX package, registry names, install folder `RNG Media\DocDog`, new UpgradeCode, version resource), FreeBSD; vendor RNG Media S.L.
